1
00:00:23,744 --> 00:00:28,483
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,483 --> 00:00:32,195
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,419 --> 00:00:34,664
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:35,011 --> 00:00:37,718
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,597 --> 00:00:43,125
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,125 --> 00:00:46,757
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,235 --> 00:00:50,723
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,867 --> 00:00:55,363
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,363 --> 00:01:00,003
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,391 --> 00:01:02,051
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,051 --> 00:01:08,003
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,195 --> 00:01:11,883
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,883 --> 00:01:15,454
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,619 --> 00:01:22,563
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:23,011 --> 00:01:26,632
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,632 --> 00:01:30,316
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,403 --> 00:01:35,331
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,331 --> 00:01:39,491
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,235 --> 00:01:46,787
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,331 --> 00:01:49,987
=Episode 22=

21
00:01:50,496 --> 00:01:55,235
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

22
00:01:55,235 --> 00:01:58,947
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

23
00:01:59,171 --> 00:02:01,416
♪A cold face♪

24
00:02:01,763 --> 00:02:04,470
♪With two lines of tears♪

25
00:02:05,349 --> 00:02:09,877
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

26
00:02:11,159 --> 00:02:13,400
Mr. Rong, sing.

27
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:18,319
This is probably
your last performance in this world.

28
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:21,159
Mr. Rong.

29
00:02:25,599 --> 00:02:28,919
Fine. If you don't sing now,

30
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:33,479
you can sing on your way
to the underworld.

31
00:02:34,039 --> 00:02:37,120
(Shitou, you must survive.)

32
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:59,599
I once had a brother too.

33
00:02:59,919 --> 00:03:01,199
When I finally found him,

34
00:03:01,759 --> 00:03:03,840
he was already dead.

35
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,479
I dare to come to you

36
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:08,240
because I know you won't kill me.

37
00:03:11,759 --> 00:03:13,879
Today, I have to protect Rong Xiaonan!

38
00:03:15,719 --> 00:03:17,159
You want to save him?

39
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:41,240
Shitou.

40
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:47,080
Hold on.

41
00:03:48,159 --> 00:03:48,960
Xu You'an,

42
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:52,560
Don't think that putting on an act
with a fake Buddha Head

43
00:03:52,879 --> 00:03:54,520
can help you escape.

44
00:03:58,719 --> 00:04:00,000
Whether it's real or fake

45
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:03,400
depends on whether
you dare to bet with me.

46
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:09,400
You should know I've never been
afraid of mutual destruction

47
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,599
or going down together.

48
00:04:15,879 --> 00:04:16,680
Stop!

49
00:04:20,279 --> 00:04:21,079
No.

50
00:04:23,879 --> 00:04:24,680
Go.

51
00:04:25,959 --> 00:04:27,040
For Chun'er.

52
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:29,560
Shitou.

53
00:04:30,848 --> 00:04:33,175
♪Burned out this life♪

54
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:34,160
Just go!

55
00:04:36,542 --> 00:04:38,487
♪I ask why♪

56
00:04:38,839 --> 00:04:43,525
♪I yearn for the one who's gone
through heat and cold♪

57
00:04:43,863 --> 00:04:45,525
♪A handful of earth♪

58
00:04:45,719 --> 00:04:48,296
♪The world's last gamble♪

59
00:04:48,559 --> 00:04:52,221
♪Sighing at the late hour♪

60
00:04:53,101 --> 00:04:58,711
♪No one comes to meet me♪

61
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,439
Go to the Rongqing Troupe.

62
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:39,399
You knew all along that I'm Zhuzi?

63
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,759
When I called you Shitou just now,

64
00:05:42,439 --> 00:05:43,439
you weren't surprised.

65
00:05:47,199 --> 00:05:48,120
Shitou,

66
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,720
why did you hide it from me?

67
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:58,680
(The current situation is precarious.)

68
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:00,600
(I thought I'd hide it from you)

69
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:02,720
(so you wouldn't be too heartbroken.)

70
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:05,040
(Very well.)

71
00:06:05,959 --> 00:06:08,800
(Meeting you again
has resolved a regret.)

72
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:12,079
You're still as nagging
as when you were young.

73
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,160
I'm asking you.

74
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,240
When exactly did you find out?

75
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:17,720
Why didn't you tell me?

76
00:06:22,079 --> 00:06:25,519
I found the button you dropped here.

77
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,160
When I got the button,

78
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,639
too many things happened.

79
00:06:58,240 --> 00:07:00,839
But luckily, you found me.

80
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,800
So you kept your promise.

81
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,160
Governor.

82
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:37,240
Did you get the explosives planted?

83
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:38,000
Yes.

84
00:07:38,279 --> 00:07:39,079
Good.

85
00:07:41,879 --> 00:07:42,800
Xu You'an,

86
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:47,319
you wanted to fool me
with a fake Buddha Head?

87
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:51,560
I'll blast you to pieces.

88
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:58,800
What's going on?

89
00:07:59,279 --> 00:08:00,600
Why isn't Miss Jiang back yet?

90
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:01,759
Is she alright?

91
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:04,879
I told her to follow secretly.
She'll be fine.

92
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:10,160
Only by following Xu Fan can we find out
where the Jade Buddha Head is hidden.

93
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:12,800
But what if she acts impulsively?

94
00:08:13,639 --> 00:08:14,600
She won't.

95
00:08:14,879 --> 00:08:16,360
Chun'er listens to me now.

96
00:08:25,959 --> 00:08:27,079
Today is the Lantern Festival.

97
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:30,160
Yes.

98
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:34,240
The full moon brings families together.

99
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:38,279
Once Chun'er arrives,
we can consider ourselves reunited.

100
00:08:43,399 --> 00:08:44,200
Miss Jiang.

101
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,480
I followed Xu Fan all the way

102
00:08:47,799 --> 00:08:49,759
and found his car parked
at the Rongqing Troupe.

103
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:52,320
But I saw him come out
not long after he went in.

104
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:55,159
I was afraid of an ambush,
so I didn't dare go in.

105
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:59,840
Now we must take back
the Jade Buddha Head from Xu Fan.

106
00:09:00,759 --> 00:09:02,200
If he trades the Jade Buddha Head

107
00:09:02,519 --> 00:09:03,559
for the weapons,

108
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:07,480
given his nature, he will surely
plunge the people into misery.

109
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:10,279
But the Rongqing Troupe's front yard
is guarded by soldiers.

110
00:09:10,679 --> 00:09:12,919
I'm afraid we'll be discovered
before we even enter.

111
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,200
I have a plan.

112
00:09:18,879 --> 00:09:20,480
A secret passage in my master's room

113
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:23,440
leads directly to the backstage
of the front yard

114
00:09:24,519 --> 00:09:25,759
and bypasses the soldiers.

115
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:29,399
But now Xu Fan will be
even more cautious.

116
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:31,799
This is our only chance.

117
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:34,039
So we can't act rashly.

118
00:09:34,399 --> 00:09:35,840
We must plan thoroughly

119
00:09:35,879 --> 00:09:36,879
and strike with one move

120
00:09:36,919 --> 00:09:38,039
to get the Buddha Head back.

121
00:09:56,928 --> 00:10:01,667
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

122
00:10:01,667 --> 00:10:05,379
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

123
00:10:05,603 --> 00:10:07,848
♪A cold face♪

124
00:10:08,195 --> 00:10:10,902
♪With two lines of tears♪

125
00:10:11,781 --> 00:10:16,309
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

126
00:10:16,309 --> 00:10:19,941
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

127
00:10:20,419 --> 00:10:23,907
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

128
00:10:26,051 --> 00:10:28,547
♪The storyteller says♪

129
00:10:28,547 --> 00:10:33,187
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

130
00:10:33,575 --> 00:10:35,235
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

131
00:10:35,235 --> 00:10:41,187
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

132
00:10:41,379 --> 00:10:45,067
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

133
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:48,720
In my dreams, I've returned here
countless times.

134
00:10:49,879 --> 00:10:51,840
Now that I'm standing here for real,

135
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:56,519
I still feel as if I'm in a dream
and haven't woken up.

136
00:10:59,816 --> 00:11:03,500
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

137
00:11:03,587 --> 00:11:08,515
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

138
00:11:08,515 --> 00:11:12,675
♪How can I bear to let go♪

139
00:11:13,879 --> 00:11:14,919
Look again now.

140
00:11:15,399 --> 00:11:16,399
Are you still in a dream?

141
00:11:17,792 --> 00:11:21,363
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

142
00:11:21,528 --> 00:11:28,472
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

143
00:11:28,920 --> 00:11:32,480
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

144
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:34,720
I'm taller than you now.

145
00:11:38,519 --> 00:11:40,120
It's ready. Come over here.

146
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:45,400
♪How can I bear to let go♪

147
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,480
Have you finished?

148
00:11:58,799 --> 00:11:59,840
You do it then.

149
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:00,480
Go back.

150
00:12:00,600 --> 00:12:01,240
I'll do it.

151
00:12:01,559 --> 00:12:02,799
Press the air bulb.

152
00:12:02,879 --> 00:12:04,039
Is it the air bulb?

153
00:12:05,559 --> 00:12:06,360
It's done?

154
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:07,360
Hurry.

155
00:12:09,559 --> 00:12:10,360
Did it work?

156
00:12:10,879 --> 00:12:11,879
I think so.

157
00:12:13,519 --> 00:12:14,759
Let's just take another one.

158
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:17,919
Ready?

159
00:12:17,919 --> 00:12:18,720
Hurry.

160
00:12:21,679 --> 00:12:22,960
It should be done this time.

161
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:26,240
You have to smile for photos.

162
00:12:26,240 --> 00:12:27,759
Why are you two so tense?

163
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:29,240
Smile.

164
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:35,519
You two might as well not smile.

165
00:12:35,519 --> 00:12:37,000
Your smiles look worse than crying.

166
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:38,399
Just smile.

167
00:12:40,759 --> 00:12:41,799
Smile again.

168
00:13:16,288 --> 00:13:17,568
♪As if it were fate♪

169
00:13:17,568 --> 00:13:18,925
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

170
00:13:19,487 --> 00:13:22,724
♪We miss each other♪

171
00:13:23,968 --> 00:13:25,536
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

172
00:13:25,536 --> 00:13:27,936
♪And a bizarre♪

173
00:13:27,936 --> 00:13:30,738
♪Anonymous legend♪

174
00:13:31,268 --> 00:13:33,280
♪The plot twists and turns♪

175
00:13:33,428 --> 00:13:35,168
♪Play out over and over again♪

176
00:13:35,168 --> 00:13:38,232
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

177
00:13:38,813 --> 00:13:40,512
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

178
00:13:40,512 --> 00:13:41,504
♪Refuse to submit♪

179
00:13:41,504 --> 00:13:44,704
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

180
00:13:46,368 --> 00:13:49,280
♪There are always too many♪

181
00:13:49,280 --> 00:13:51,168
♪Helpless situations♪

182
00:13:51,168 --> 00:13:53,792
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

183
00:13:54,923 --> 00:13:56,883
♪Even if I have questions♪

184
00:13:56,883 --> 00:13:58,883
♪I harbor desires♪

185
00:13:58,883 --> 00:14:01,760
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

186
00:14:02,111 --> 00:14:03,744
♪People come and go♪

187
00:14:03,744 --> 00:14:06,560
♪I'm still all alone♪

188
00:14:06,560 --> 00:14:09,288
♪Wandering around♪

189
00:14:09,536 --> 00:14:12,389
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

190
00:14:12,389 --> 00:14:16,850
♪Go through the entanglement♪

191
00:14:17,216 --> 00:14:18,944
♪If longing♪

192
00:14:18,944 --> 00:14:22,103
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

193
00:14:22,103 --> 00:14:24,858
♪How can I be at ease♪

194
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:27,274
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

195
00:14:27,392 --> 00:14:29,248
♪And travelled around the world♪

196
00:14:29,344 --> 00:14:32,432
♪Scars all over me♪

197
00:14:32,704 --> 00:14:35,616
♪If longing never fades♪

198
00:14:35,616 --> 00:14:37,065
♪Burns still hot♪

199
00:14:37,065 --> 00:14:40,144
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

200
00:14:40,416 --> 00:14:42,273
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

201
00:14:42,336 --> 00:14:43,520
♪In the next life♪

202
00:14:43,520 --> 00:14:48,000
♪Entangle with you again♪
